{"id":"n44878-4-3","stage":0,"title":"이것 · 这孩子","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n44878-4-3-1","ko":"이것이 제 아들 놈입니다.","zh":"这是我家那小子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이것이","meaning":"这孩子","explanation":"이것 在这里亲昵或谦虚地指眼前这个孩子；-이 标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"4","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이것이","audio":"/audio/0c1619f1b90cff313086.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我的","explanation":"제 是 저의 的缩略，表示“我的”；저 是“我”的谦称。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"아들","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子。","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}},{"text":"놈입니다.","meaning":"我家那小子","explanation":"놈：亲近或谦称自家孩子时可说“小子”；-입니다 是正式礼貌的判断句末。","readings":[{"term":"놈","audio":"/audio/8cb9618fb00ec4c42e61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74193","senseId":"4","lemma":"놈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놈입니다","audio":"/audio/48e592b470a46717750e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这孩子、这小子（亲昵称呼）","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"亲昵或谦虚地指眼前的孩子；这里指说话人的儿子。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"65e567305972e652","term":"아들","zh":"儿子","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3","entryId":"20240","definition":"男性子女。","pronunciation":["아들"]},{"id":"8cb9618fb00ec4c4","term":"놈","zh":"小子（亲近或自谦）","audio":"/audio/8cb9618fb00ec4c42e61.mp3","entryId":"74193","definition":"亲近或自谦地称呼男性或自家孩子；语气依关系而变。","pronunciation":["놈"]}],"audio":"/audio/945b6db88c7c65f81d41.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n44878-4-3-2","ko":"아버지를 닮아 잘 생겼네요.","zh":"长得真像他父亲，很帅呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지를","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지를","audio":"/audio/c36fbe9284137ce6c1a1.mp3"}},{"text":"닮아","meaning":"像，随","explanation":"닮다：像，随；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"닮다","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73354","senseId":"1","lemma":"닮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닮아","audio":"/audio/c7f20d4f6a45a203b96b.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"帅气地","explanation":"잘 생기다 是“长得好看、帅”；잘 在这里修饰后面的 생기다。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"10","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"생겼네요.","meaning":"长得很帅呢","explanation":"생기다：长成某种相貌；与 잘 合用是“长得帅”，-었- 表示结果状态，-네요 表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"4","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생겼네요","audio":"/audio/04ea252f70c470a45d0f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"593cd68a24885987","term":"닮다","zh":"像，随","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3","entryId":"73354","definition":"指两个以上的人或事物拥有相似的长相或属性。","pronunciation":["담ː따"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好看地，漂亮地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常帅气而美丽地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"人或事物的长相成为某种样子。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ab87221255fb18a8fc6e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.925,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=44878","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":24,"sequenceScore":1.0362,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["长得真像他父亲，很帅呢。","上课时要安静哦。","这是我家那小子。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["长得真像他父亲，很帅呢。","这是我家那小子。","上课时要安静哦。"],"answer":0}]}
